      "description": "Promoted to Team Lead of Internal Operations thanks to consistent and exceptional performance, ownership over work, and strong leadership qualities\n\n- Spearheading development of a scalable and expandable system to bill customers based on their usage of existing services to create a new income source generated from a significant number of customers\n\n- Contributing technical insight to the planning and specifications of upcoming large-scale projects\n\n- Mentoring less experienced engineers on coding best practices and resolving complex issues efficiently",
