      "totalDuration": "3 yrs 8 mos",
      "description": "Worked on an agile development team implementing features of varying complexity into the existing CRM platform. Built on an Angular front end and a PHP (Laravel/Lumen) & MySQL backend.\n\n- Public API: Implemented multiple public CRUD endpoints for the end users to integrate with, or allow their 3rd party vendors to integrate with.\n\n- Security Improvements: Implemented a fully custom Two-Factor Authentication system, additional minimum password requirements, and forced password reset functionality.\n\n- Roles & Permissions System: Designed and implemented an extensive and granular roles and permissions management system spanning across the entire application. It was designed to give the end users full control over which user can access each part of the system.\n\n- Optimized existing application functionality in order to improve processing time and page load speed by up to 90%. Actionable items included reducing code complexity in functions, updating indexes in the MySQL database, as well as optimizing existing MySQL queries with data points such as query cost\n\n- Moved to leading a sub-team developing a brand new mobile application written in Flutter/Dart. This mobile app integrated with the existing PHP API and is developed alongside our primary web application. The main focus is on giving the end users a clean UI/UX to handle the core functionality of the web application on the go.\n\n- After completing the mobile app's initial release version and ensuring the customers had a stable product to work with, I moved back into the web application team to help with development on more complex backend projects.",
      "insights": "PHP, Laravel and +3 skills"
     }
